words": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ksfCJ4GuYbUQ7kNvwE4P8t9&_nc_oc=AdosKvekVdjlapnTc2j-WRYhyz9OOScvRdOK0JClg2RKSgKVMY9sIUC8uVVd_hXvnS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxlcrx6P2CHcDR6s0QDeEShPmfKUOJRqf3BTaLR33E-kQ&oe=69C13F41"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=STz0Yd_TblwQ7kNvwHMAfiJ&_nc_oc=Adqy9CJE4jWX-muWUTyTQzxfxCZPRU7kgRaRVnyi1uhPkw1vfxFFBtC1gG-e2ywhtBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxstto_HKPTsGOa4F2FO3aL4motHl3nc9eSEqOKbkw4AA&oe=69C133B3"}, {"file_name": "Cover-Square.png", "id": "811623013181900", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974629_811623016515233_3126397619395326849_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZXSMAvwXdI4Q7kNvwGO3y6K&_nc_oc=Adp_z7oGTMTSzz7pLVOoqH1WwVPSNf31cfZpANe4jKcKoZIGzyReyeq7